---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About - Batuhan Ozturk" description="AI & Automation Architect, former professional athlete, building systems that create competitive advantage">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <header class="text-center mb-12">
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <div class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
        <p class="mb-6">
          My name is <strong>Batuhan</strong> - Former professional athlete and now an AI & Automation Architect (officially senior digital automation manager).
        </p>
        
        <p class="mb-6">
          I design and build systems that create competitive advantage—for both pioneering companies and the next generation of business leaders. At <a href="https://ai-group.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">AI.GROUP</a>, I lead projects that use AI to solve core business problems of all associated companies within AI.GROUP. My work involves designing automated systems that drive growth and efficiency, from building intelligent marketing and sales engines to creating fully automated venture capital frameworks for <a href="https://ai-fund.vc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">AI.FUND</a>.
        </p>
        
        <p class="mb-6">
          My approach is a synthesis of three distinct fields: the strategic business acumen from my MBA, a deep understanding of social dynamics from my studies in sociology, and the technical skill of an AI architect. This allows me to see beyond pure technology. I focus on how AI can be used to build tangible influence and authority. This is my core mission when working with ambitious professionals—architecting the systems that transform their expertise into real-world impact and symbolic capital.
        </p>
        
        <p class="mb-6">
          This philosophy began with my master's project, where I built an engine to analyze the self-presentation of leading athletes on social media. The system used visual and quantitative analysis to map precisely how they build global brands and become more than just great performers. It identified the specific patterns that create authority—a methodology I have been refining ever since.
        </p>
        
        <p class="mb-6">
          I apply this same first-principles thinking to my corporate work. For AI.FUND, I built a fully autonomous system that manages the deal flow pipeline. It ingests and analyzes pitch decks, conducts research on the startups, generates investment notes, and integrates the data into our tool infrastructure. The system provides a deep layer of analysis, freeing up the investment team to focus on strategic decisions.
        </p>
        
        <p class="mb-8">
          From an athlete building authority to a VC fund assessing a startup, the underlying challenge is the same: turning information into a strategic asset. My work is about building the intelligent systems that make this happen.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-border pt-12 pb-8">
        <p class="mb-8 text-center">
          I'm always interested in connecting with ambitious professionals and innovative companies looking to build competitive advantage through intelligent systems.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
          <!-- LinkedIn -->
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ozturkbatu/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-[#0077B5] hover:bg-[#005885] text-white rounded-lg transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="LinkedIn">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M20.5 2h-17A1.5 1.5 0 002 3.5v17A1.5 1.5 0 003.5 22h17a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.5v-17A1.5 1.5 0 0020.5 2zM8 19H5v-9h3zM6.5 8.25A1.75 1.75 0 118.3 6.5a1.78 1.78 0 01-1.8 1.75zM19 19h-3v-4.74c0-1.42-.6-1.93-1.38-1.93A1.74 1.74 0 0013 14.19a.66.66 0 000 .14V19h-3v-9h2.9v1.3a3.11 3.11 0 012.7-1.4c1.55 0 3.36.86 3.36 3.66z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          
          <!-- X (Twitter) - Black icon on white background -->
